The levels on which water-crossing is naively necessary, and
ways to avoid it:

Medusa (digging/levelport on the way down, cPoGL up)

The Castle (levelport down, cPoGL up)
The fake wizard's tower with the portal }   (bring Rodney to you with
The bottom level of the Wizard's Tower  }   a pet mindflayer or a drum
The top level of the Wizard's Tower     }   of earthquake)
The Vibrating Square after the invocation (cPoGL)

Juiblex' Swamp may have one or both stairs surrounded by water (see Medusa)

The Healer Quest home level definitively requires you to cross water;
the goal level does also unless you get the Cyclops to come to you.
Similarly, the Valkyrie Quest goal level requires you to cross lava
(at least by drawbridge, possibly just to leave the stairs) unless you
break Lord Surtur's meditation from afar.

